{"message":"The best fit is the Green Fee-Free Account: you would receive $20 and your roommate would receive $35, for a combined $55. Her approximately $600 paycheck exceeds the $300 qualifying deposit, which must be made within 60 days of opening and remain new money. You must have been a Rho-Bank checking customer for at least 30 days; your referral history indicates you have already met that tenure requirement.

For comparison, the Light Blue Account offers a combined $50 and requires a $500 deposit. Accounts with larger combined bonuses require deposits of at least $1,000 or more, so they would not fit a $600 paycheck.

Important eligibility conditions: your roommate must be a new Rho-Bank customer with no account currently or closed within the past 12 months, be at least 18, and not be registered at the same address as you. The referral bonus cannot be combined with another new-account promotion, and only one referral code may be used. Both accounts must remain in good standing; early closure may result in a clawback."}
